{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_04_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_04",
  "title": "機獸咆哮",
  "storyCode": "RI-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9570ca5dd878bf40ae71ee8c299b16469f2aa900931954966a4bddccce8e99b3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_temple_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯嘍囉A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘎哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯嘍囉B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太、太強了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏代",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算你厲害！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿魯納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "森蚺，別得意！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿魯納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小的們，上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，不愧是祖瑪瑪，果然很厲害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然只有一個人，一般的阿達克利斯也不是她的對手，就像嘉維爾一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你好像很熟悉她。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嗯，祖瑪瑪和嘉維爾從前開始就是我們這一帶最厲害的兩個人呢。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "不過據我所知，祖瑪瑪從來沒有贏過嘉維爾哦！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士。在外面這麼厲害的人一定很少見吧！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "但是，嘉維爾更厲害哦！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "好帥的女孩子。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "唔，雖然祖瑪瑪確實很帥。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "但是，嘉維爾更帥！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對吧，嘉維爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，嘉維爾呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你們看，那個人是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我剛才在來的路上就看到了，她是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_072",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她居然真的回來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "所有人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇啊啊啊啊，嘉維爾直接衝上台了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好久不見啊，祖瑪瑪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在應該叫你森蚺頭領了對吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你居然回來了，嘉維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，特米米叫我回來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？等等，你居然也會說薩爾貢語？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......既然你也會這種語言，看來這種語言確實是外面的語言沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我學習了很久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我以為你不會再回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會回來的，不是現在，未來也會回來的，這裡是我的家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你要當大酋長？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，本來我只是找你有點事，打完再找你也沒關係的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，你這傢伙變得這麼厲害了，這讓我怎麼忍得住啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的去做醫生了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，我在外面可是很有名的醫生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢，上次的時候你不是在搗鼓自己的東西沒有參加嗎？終於搗鼓好了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你馬上就會見到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_temple_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚，嘉維爾不是說她不會出手的嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "嘉維爾出乎你的意料了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "誒？沒、沒有的事！只、只是......."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士也看入迷了......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嗚嗚，雖然確實很帥，但是......"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "這才是嘉維爾。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嗚嗚，雖然這麼說是沒錯。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你還是那麼強，嘉維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，你也不差啊，祖瑪瑪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，你太依賴你的拳頭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的拳頭讓你可以做到許多事，所以你從不考慮用拳頭以外的東西做事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是你的局限性，也是我們這些人的局限性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你到底在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在說，該改變了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "隨著“嘿咻”，“嘿咻”整齊的喊聲，林間似乎有什麼龐然大物在靠近神廟。\n它緩慢，而又堅實地“走”著，還不見其全貌，就已經讓人感覺它無堅不摧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你確實很強，嘉維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原本，我是想在成為大酋長後再用它的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，我不得不用它來對付你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，結果是一樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它將改變這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然不知道你在說什麼，不過我可沒那麼輕易倒下啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你會輕易地倒下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......大祭司，瞄準，開炮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼，那是？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_temple_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，我說了，嘉維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，用它對付你，並不是我本來的目的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "靠拳頭是沒有未來的，嘉維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來，是機器的時代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
